  "content": {
    "prompt": "Write Python code that sets count to 9. If count plus 1 is equal to 10, multiply count by 2 and store it back. Then, in a separate if statement, if count is greater than 15, subtract 4 from count and store it back. Otherwise, add 4 to count and store it back. Print the final value of count.",
    "source_code": "count = 9\nif count + 1 == 10:\n    count = count * 2\nif count > 15:\n    count = count - 4\nelse:\n    count = count + 4\nprint(count)\n"
  },
